   disclosure_controls_change_the_view_without_reparsing_or_core_operations
   exercises the rendered action, changes visibility and preserves parse counts.
   The headless smoke checks multiple resolved glyph colours in a Rust code block.
2. Changes: view.rs:1204 uses Diff::parse and DiffView for FileChange/TurnDiff,
   with fold actions. smoke.rs:113 checks actual add/remove text and distinct
