7. gui_budget still drives Bridge::drain_with_clock: 300us stop, deferred wake,
   no loss and unchanged completed layouts retained. gui_rich.rs:118 streams an
   exact 65536-byte unfinished paragraph in 256-byte increments through the real
   worker preparer. It counts actual parser ranges, asserts <=4x received bytes
   and verifies an unchanged completed layout is reused. Parse credit limits
   pathological unfinished blocks; deferred bytes stay visible as literal text,
   and completion flushes through streaming append. Width/disclosure changes
   deliberately require a different layout; unchanged completed inputs do not.
8. Makefile smoke now replays tests/fixtures/gui/rich-all-items.jsonl offscreen.
